::  name       pond preset offset gate, rune spelling
::  shape      offset count - ints (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers exactly as gate-pond-preset-offset-u32 -- one law, the ancestor's runes
::  example    0 0 -> 1 · 5 5 -> 0
::  readers    Pond · the hearth shelf · Glow
::  nib        alias-sameness twin of the preset offset gate (20260830)
::
::  The same shelf-offset law wearing ?& and ?| -- alias-sameness: one body kind,
::  one parse path, one emit, and neither spelling owns a behavior of its own.
|=  [offset=@u32 count=@u32]
?:  (?& (?| (gth offset count) (eq offset count)) (?| (gth offset 0) (gth count 0)))  0  1
